---
import { projectAssets } from "../data/projects";
import ProjectImage from "./ProjectImage.astro";
---
<section class="urmilStudy sectionSpace" id="urmilStudy">
	<div class="sectionHeading"><div><p class="sectionLabel">The idea & the outcome</p><h2>From a line<br />to a landmark.</h2></div><p>Explore Urmil’s elevation and built exterior alongside the spatial planning of its Madhu Vihar showroom. A dialogue between the drawing, the design and the built space.</p></div>
	<div class="studyGrid">
		<figure class="comparisonFigure">
			<div class="comparison" data-comparison data-image-frame="portrait" style="--comparisonPosition: 50%">
				<div class="comparisonLayer comparisonBase"><img src={projectAssets.urmilAfter} alt="Site photograph of the built Urmil Jewellers exterior with pale cladding, tall windows and vertical signage" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" /></div>
				<div class="comparisonLayer comparisonOverlay"><img src={projectAssets.urmilBefore} alt="Urmil Jewellers corner elevation concept with angular glazing and illuminated facade edges" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" /></div>
				<span class="comparisonLabel comparisonLabel--before">Design visualisation</span><span class="comparisonLabel comparisonLabel--after">Built result</span>
				<div class="comparisonDivider" aria-hidden="true"><span>↔</span></div>
				<label class="srOnly" for="urmilComparison">Compare Urmil’s design visualisation with the built result</label><input id="urmilComparison" class="comparisonRange" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-valuetext="50 percent design visualisation" />
			</div>
			<figcaption><span>Urmil Jewellers</span><span>Drag to explore the transformation</span></figcaption>
		</figure>
		<div class="studyPlan"><figure><a href={projectAssets.urmilMap} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open Urmil Madhu Vihar’s spatial plan at full size"><ProjectImage src={projectAssets.urmilMap} alt="Urmil Madhu Vihar’s three-dimensional floor plan showing counters, seating, entrance and back rooms" width={1500} height={1050} /><span class="planImageOpen" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><figcaption>Urmil Jewellers Madhu Vihar / The space, seen from above.</figcaption></figure><h3>Every detail has its place.</h3><p>Circulation, display and the quieter spaces behind the showroom are considered together. The plan gives the experience its structure.</p></div>
	</div>
</section>
